1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,160
This AI tool takes apart any app to show

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,240
you how it works.

3
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:05,660
Point your agent at a program.

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,180
No source code needed.

5
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,020
REA pulls out the assembly,

6
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,370
the pseudocode, every string and symbol.

7
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:14,880
It even rebuilt a sound routine from an

8
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,360
old game, byte for byte.

9
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,100
Then your agent can build that feature for

10
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:19,570
you.

11
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:22,220
It's called REA.

12
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:24,680
25,000 GitHub stars in one day.

13
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,580
Free, open source, and it runs on your

14
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,260
machine.
